      "explanation": "The module uses a counter indexed by the BR (baud rate) input to produce a divided clock sclk_m, which is then conditionally gated by nss_out (chip select) and rx_only/bit8_out (mode) to produce the final sclk_out. It also generates a completion pulse sclk_done based on a configurable bit width (DFF).",
